WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.713 --> 00:00:06.590
There is an animal in Africa

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:10.093
that truly reflects our sense of family.

00:00:12.638 --> 00:00:14.431
Meet Mimi, the newborn...

00:00:16.975 --> 00:00:18.602
Wewe, the toddler,

00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:22.231
and Athena, who looks after them all.

00:00:24.066 --> 00:00:29.029
Their entire world is built on the love
and strength of their family.

00:00:30.489 --> 00:00:33.825
Home is a water hole in paradise.

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:40.666
But one day, it all changes.

00:00:45.254 --> 00:00:50.259
Experience the incredible story
of an inspirational leader...

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:53.554
the loved ones she must protect...

00:00:54.263 --> 00:00:55.889
the home they must leave...

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.976
the journey they must take.

